{"id":"696b8ae0-0589-42f1-a816-b5c04bf86a84","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:46:24.905Z","batchId":"states_gpt-6-luna_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"states","prompt":"Two states for a file list: an empty state with an upload call to action, and an error state with a retry button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .state-tabs { display: flex; gap: .5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border, currentColor); padding-bottom: .75rem; }\n  .state-panel[hidden] { display: none; }\n  .state-art { width: 3.5rem; height: 3.5rem; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 1rem; background: var(--muted, rgba(127,127,127,.12)); }\n  .state-art svg { width: 1.75rem; height: 1.75rem; }\n  .state-content { min-height: 18rem; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1rem; }\n  .state-content-inner { max-width: 27rem; }\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"muted small\">Workspace / Files</div>\n    <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h1 class=\"h1\">Project files</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Browse and manage the files in this project.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\">Close</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"file-list-heading\">\n    <div class=\"between row gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"file-list-heading\">Files</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Your project files will appear here.</p>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">0 files</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"state-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"File list state\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" id=\"empty-tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"empty-panel\">Empty state</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" id=\"error-tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"error-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\">Error state</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"state-panel\" id=\"empty-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"empty-tab\">\n      <div class=\"state-content\">\n        <div class=\"state-content-inner stack gap-lg center\">\n          <div class=\"state-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <path d=\"M13 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V10z\"/>\n              <path d=\"M13 3v7h7M12 17v-5m-2 2 2-2 2 2\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <h3 class=\"h3\">No files yet</h3>\n            <p class=\"muted\">Upload a file to get started. You can add documents, images, and other project assets.</p>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span> Upload files\n          </button>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Choose files from your device to add them to this project.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"state-panel\" id=\"error-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"error-tab\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"state-content\">\n        <div class=\"state-content-inner stack gap-lg center\">\n          <div class=\"state-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/>\n              <path d=\"M12 7v6m0 4h.01\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Couldn't load files</span>\n            <h3 class=\"h3\">Something went wrong</h3>\n            <p class=\"muted\">We couldn't retrieve the files for this project. Check your connection and try again.</p>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"retry-button\" type=\"button\">Try again</button>\n          <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"retry-message\" aria-live=\"polite\">Your files have not been changed.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  (() => {\n    const tabs = [\n      { button: document.getElementById('empty-tab'), panel: document.getElementById('empty-panel') },\n      { button: document.getElementById('error-tab'), panel: document.getElementById('error-panel') }\n    ];\n\n    function activateTab(index) {\n      tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {\n        const active = i === index;\n        tab.button.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));\n        tab.button.tabIndex = active ? 0 : -1;\n        tab.button.classList.toggle('btn-outline', !active);\n        tab.panel.hidden = !active;\n      });\n      tabs[index].button.focus();\n    }\n\n    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {\n      tab.button.addEventListener('click', () => activateTab(index));\n      tab.button.addEventListener('keydown', event => {\n        if (event.key === 'ArrowRight' || event.key === 'ArrowLeft') {\n          event.preventDefault();\n          activateTab((index + (event.key === 'ArrowRight' ? 1 : tabs.length - 1)) % tabs.length);\n        }\n      });\n    });\n\n    document.getElementById('retry-button').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const message = document.getElementById('retry-message');\n      message.textContent = 'Retrying…';\n      window.setTimeout(() => {\n        message.textContent = 'Still unable to load files. Check your connection and try again.';\n      }, 800);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[10517,"<style"],[10522,">\n"],[10525," "],[10529," ."],[10532,"state"],[10536,"-tabs"],[10539," {"],[10543," display"],[10546,":"],[10552," flex"],[10557,";"],[10564," gap"],[10566,":"],[10569," ."],[10572,"5"],[10575,"rem"],[10580,";"],[10583," border"],[10587,"-bottom"],[10590,":"],[10595," "],[10598,"1"],[10603,"px"],[10606," solid"],[10613," var"],[10616,"(--"],[10623,"border"],[10626,","],[10632," current"],[10636,"Color"],[10640,");"],[10645," padding"],[10647,"-bottom"],[10651,":"],[10656," ."],[10662,"75"],[10671,"rem"],[10675,";"],[10682," }\n"],[10685," "],[10688," ."],[10694,"state"],[10701,"-panel"],[10705,"["],[10711,"hidden"],[10715,"]"],[10721," {"],[10730," display"],[10734,":"],[10737," none"],[10741,";"],[10746," }\n"],[10753," "],[10758," ."],[10763,"state"],[10770,"-art"],[10777," {"],[10779," width"],[10785,":"],[10790," "],[10796,"3"],[10799,"."],[10805,"5"],[10809,"rem"],[10812,";"],[10820," height"],[10822,":"],[10826," "],[10829,"3"],[10836,"."],[10837,"5"],[10843,"rem"],[10846,";"],[10851," display"],[10854,":"],[10856," grid"],[10864,";"],[10865," place"],[10866,"-items"],[10869,":"],[10872," center"],[10875,";"],[10879," border"],[10883,"-radius"],[10887,":"],[10893," "],[10900,"1"],[10904,"rem"],[10908,";"],[10912," background"],[10921,":"],[10923," var"],[10931,"(--"],[10936,"mut"],[10940,"ed"],[10946,","],[10952," rgba"],[10964,"("],[10967,"127"],[10973,","],[10979,"127"],[10985,","],[10990,"127"],[10993,",."],[10997,"12"],[11003,"));"],[11008," }\n"],[11012," "],[11014," ."],[11017,"state"],[11022,"-art"],[11028," svg"],[11031," {"],[11036," width"],[11045,":"],[11050," "],[11057,"1"],[11062,"."],[11063,"75"],[11065,"rem"],[11075,";"],[11075," heigh